{"signature": "{\"text\": \"Let us consider a pile driver. A hammer with a mass of 120 kilograms is raised through a vertical height of four metres. Taking g as ten newtons per kilogram, the change in G P E equals 120 multiplied by ten multiplied by four. That is 4,800 joules. The hammer has gained 4,800 joules in its gravitational potential energy store.\", \"voice\": \"en-NG-AbeoNeural\", \"rate\": \"-4%\", \"eleven\": true}", "duration": 24.659592, "words": [["Let", 0.0], ["us", 0.255], ["consider", 0.395], ["a", 0.906], ["pile", 1.033], ["driver.", 1.37], ["A", 2.194], ["hammer", 2.426], ["with", 2.786], ["a", 2.972], ["mass", 3.088], ["of", 3.379], ["120", 3.576], ["kilograms", 4.505], ["is", 5.19], ["raised", 5.445], ["through", 5.793], ["a", 6.049], ["vertical", 6.13], ["height", 6.641], ["of", 6.954], ["four", 7.117], ["metres.", 7.442], ["Taking", 8.301], ["g", 8.824], ["as", 9.056], ["ten", 9.265], ["newtons", 9.567], ["per", 10.043], ["kilogram,", 10.263], ["the", 11.134], ["change", 11.331], ["in", 11.714], ["GPE", 11.854], ["equals", 12.771], ["120", 13.282], ["multiplied", 14.536], ["by", 15.232], ["ten", 15.418], ["multiplied", 15.685], ["by", 16.277], ["four.", 16.521], ["That", 17.195], ["is", 17.485], ["4,800", 17.694], ["joules.", 18.762], ["The", 19.517], ["hammer", 19.749], ["has", 20.144], ["gained", 20.364], ["4,800", 20.678], ["joules", 21.688], ["in", 22.141], ["its", 22.315], ["gravitational", 22.489], ["potential", 23.186], ["energy", 23.696], ["store.", 24.068]], "raw": [{"text": "Let", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.209}, {"text": "us", "start": 0.255, "end": 0.337}, {"text": "consider", "start": 0.395, "end": 0.836}, {"text": "a", "start": 0.906, "end": 0.952}, {"text": "pile", "start": 1.033, "end": 1.335}, {"text": "driver.", "start": 1.37, "end": 1.95}, {"text": "A", "start": 2.194, "end": 2.31}, {"text": "hammer", "start": 2.426, "end": 2.728}, {"text": "with", "start": 2.786, "end": 2.926}, {"text": "a", "start": 2.972, "end": 3.007}, {"te